      "content": "# MSW Program Application - Social Work or Human Services Experience (240 hours)\n\nAll MSW Program applicants must have completed a minimum of 240 hours of volunteer and/or work experience in social services in the past five\nyears. The experience must include face-to-face contact with people in need. Please complete the following table with a very specific description of\nyour duties/activities and the hours and dates of your experience.\n\n<table>\n<tr>\n<th>Dates of Volunteer/Work Experience (month/year)</th>\n<th>Total # Hours Completed</th>\n<th>Agency or Company</th>\n<th>Position Title</th>\n<th>Description of Volunteer/Work Duties/Activities</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n\n<!-- PageFooter=\"5/17/23\" -->",
